dt-bindings: gpio: apple,d2365-pmic-gpio: allow one to three reserved ranges

dt-schema reads a bare maxItems as an exact count, so a node with one or
two reserved ranges (the J81 D2207 node reserves <0 2>, <3 18>) failed
validation. Set minItems: 1.

diff -ruN a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml	2026-11-02 17:20:04
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpio/apple,d2365-pmic-gpio.yaml	2026-11-02 17:20:04
@@ -43,6 +43,7 @@
     const: 2
 
   gpio-reserved-ranges:
+    minItems: 1
     maxItems: 3
 
   interrupt-controller: true
